
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Finder submits found-item details] --> B[Listing published: With finder, not yet received by staff]
    B --> C[Staff contacts finder to arrange handoff]
    B --> D{Claim submitted?}
    D -- No --> E[Listing remains visible]
    E --> D
    D -- Yes --> F[Claim held pending staff verification]
    F --> G[Staff coordinates item handoff]
    C --> G
    G --> H{Item handed to staff?}
    H -- No --> I[Keep listing marked: With finder]
    I --> G
    H -- Yes --> J[Staff records receipt and storage location]
    J --> K[Staff verifies item against report]
    K --> L{Does it match the report?}
    L -- No --> M[Staff investigates or updates the report]
    M --> K
    L -- Yes --> N[Update listing: Verified and held at desk]
    N --> O{Pending claim?}
    O -- No --> P[Keep item securely stored]
    P --> O
    O -- Yes --> Q[Staff reviews claim and verifies claimant]
    Q --> R{Claim approved?}
    R -- No --> S[Decline claim; keep listing open]
    S --> O
    R -- Yes --> T[Arrange pickup at the desk]
    T --> U[Staff records handoff]
    U --> V[Mark item returned and close listing]
```